{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48448","headline":"劝进疏引谶 六 · 不详","name":"劝进疏引谶 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戌亥君臣乱，子丑破城隍。\n寅卯如欲定，龙蛇伏四方。\n十八成男子，洪水主刀傍。\n市朝义归政，人宁俱不荒。\n人言有恒性，也复道非常。\n爲君好思量，何□□禹汤。\n桃源花□□，李树起堂堂。\n只看寅卯岁，深水没黄杨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48448.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48448","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}